<p>The standard S.I. prefixes (all of them) are captured and exposed by the=
 <code>MeasureStandardPrefix</code> class through a set of singletons. This=
 set is not extensible (you can=E2=80=99t define your own prefix).</p>

<p>These prefixes can be applied to any <code>AtomicMeasureUnit</code> to o=
btain another <code>AtomicMeasureUnit</code> since the result of the prefix=
 application may actually be a prefixed unit or a fundamental unit.</p>

