ttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Newton_(unit)</a>):</p>

<ul>
	<li>A newton (N): its definition directly uses fundamental units: 1 N =3D =
1 kg.m.s-2</li>	<li>A dyne (dyn) is defined with the newton: 1 dyn =3D 10-5=
 N</li>	<li>A kilopond (kp) is: 1 kp =3D 9.80665 N</li></ul>

