0</sup>), <strong>MiSv</strong> (Mebi, 2<sup>20</sup>), <strong>GiSv</stron=
g> (Gibi, 2<sup>30</sup>), <strong>TiSv</strong> (Tebi, 2<sup>40</sup>), <s=
