est: ToString() method is now "roundtrippable" by default.&nbsp;(Please hav=
e a look at this excellent post&nbsp;<a href=3D"https://devblogs.microsoft.=
com/dotnet/floating-point-parsing-and-formatting-improvements-in-net-core-3=
